# KAMSJSU

Root of the certificate application `KAMSJSU`: T2-CONF: SJSU secular confinement (literal tube
certificate, D76). An opt-in library (decision D51): a plain `lake build` does not build it; `lake
build KAMSJSU` does, through the serial capped driver. This file imports the generated parts
`KAMSJSU.*`, which together import every module that `scripts/build_roots.json` assigns to
`KAMSJSU`, except the frozen theorem anchors that are still `DRAFT_SORRY` and their provider modules
(built through the library's globs). It is generated by `scripts/gen_root_imports.py`; do not edit
it by hand, and never import it.
